OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will    
OL,8,Flinger in the southwest, reducing      
OL,9,Fthrough the night. Spells of rain for  
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland but with winds easing 
OL,11,Fthere. A few showers for eastern       
OL,12,FEngland and Scotland. Feeling cold     
OL,13,Fwith a widespread frost and some icy   
OL,14,Fstretches.                             
OL,16,GMonday:FWidespread frost to start,     
OL,17,Fwith some fog lingering. Sunny and dry 
OL,18,Ffor most but cloud will thicken in the 
OL,19,Fwest, bringing further rain and strong 
OL,20,Fwinds there later. Feeling cold.       
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
