OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GOutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOn    
OL,8,FTuesday, breezy with rain, and snow    
OL,9,Ffor northern hills. Patches of rain on 
OL,10,FWednesday but mostly cloudy, cold and  
OL,11,Fdry. Sunny intervals, and showers in   
OL,12,Fthe northeast on Thursday.             
